msgid "\"Don't even think about it.\""
msgstr "„Denk nicht mal dran.“"

msgid "\"I was fine. It was quiet in there.\""
msgstr "„Mir ging's gut. Es war ruhig da drin.“"

msgid "\"I was floating. On my back.\""
msgstr "„Ich hab mich treiben lassen. Auf dem Rücken.“"

msgid "\"You summoned me with that pathetic chalk circle?\""
msgstr "„Du hast mich mit diesem armseligen Kreidekreis beschworen?“"

